 \"Maya\"\n2. create a \"mesh instance 3D\" node\n3. give \"BoxMesh\" to Mesh of the node\n4. select the box , you can see red dots , hold alt and try to change size of mesh\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29769821/bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121067/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121067/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}